# Commit trailer format

- End every commit message body with exactly:
  - `Author: Savin I. Razvan`
  - `GitHub-User: @SavinRazvan`
- `Author` is mandatory; display name must be `Savin I. Razvan`. `GitHub-User` must be `@SavinRazvan`.
- `Co-authored-by:` optional; only for real co-authors.
